  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.6.0 completes the stable 1.x CSI foundation on top of the 1.5 control-language normalization. It adds one bounded internal CSI grammar preserving 7-bit/8-bit framing, private parameter bytes, semicolon parameters, colon subparameters, empty components, intermediate bytes, and final selectors; migrates existing DA/DSR/CPR, DEC private-mode, synchronized-output, Kitty keyboard, mouse, and cursor-style CSI paths onto the shared grammar/writer; adds internal terminal/cell pixel geometry queries for later graphics; and hardens fragmentation, malformed/oversized correlated-response recovery, and monotonic timeout late-response ownership. Version 1.6 adds no public API and retains the stable 1.0–1.5 surface. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.6.0/docs/releases/1.6.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.6.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
